### 1. Gültige Bestellung senden
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-1001",
  "customer": "Max Muster",
  "amount": 125.50
}


### 2. Zweite gültige Bestellung
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-1002",
  "customer": "Anna Beispiel",
  "amount": 89.90
}


### 3. Gespeicherte Bestellungen anzeigen
GET http://localhost:8081/confirmations
Accept: application/json


### 4. Fehler testen: leere Order-ID
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "",
  "customer": "Max Muster",
  "amount": 125.50
}


### 5. Fehler testen: leerer Kunde
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-1003",
  "customer": "",
  "amount": 125.50
}


### 6. Fehler testen: negativer Betrag
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-1004",
  "customer": "Max Muster",
  "amount": -20
}